o.", "image": "engenn2le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "36000"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Peter!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      Hah.  Just kidding! Here you are.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Thanks!", "image": "engenn2le03ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 6, "time": "44000"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      What are you doing?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:       I'm going home. What are you doing now?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:      I'm studying ... or playing video games.", "image": "engenn2le03ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 7, "time": "51500"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:      Bye, Peter! Why don't you call me later?", "image": "engenn2le03ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 8, "time": "62500"}], "audiosrc": "engenn2le03ob06re2aud01"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}